      "key":"ticket_record_uniqueness",
      "statement":"Every ticket has exactly one durable authoritative record. A repository or external tracker is lawful only if it preserves required contract, history, state transition, stable identity, searchability and closure semantics without a co-equal local copy. A local filename should contain a stable id and short slug; the T-001, B-002, S-003 and C-004 filenames are recommendations, not mandatory patterns.",
      "uncertainty":""
