      "key":"upward_propagation_classification",
      "statement":"Consume SPEC_METHOD §4's exact computed classification and residuals for declared owner/layer traversal, complete relevant public membership/value delta, accepted-design scope/trace coverage and rule-determined treatment; a new role does not repeat an unchanged walk. Before realization_refactor, establish that current requirement and accepted design govern the behavior and suffice. Presence alone proves no coverage; missing/ambiguous evidence leaves treatment unknown, not the governing layer absent. A public violation does not select a new contract; re-enter the governing owner only for explicitly changed desired outcome or established governing insufficiency. Walk upward from the realised surface, check each layer and stop at the highest missing/insufficient layer: missing/insufficient requirement → requirement_reprice and its owner; sufficient requirement but missing/insufficient design → design_reframe and Design; actual Goal/Intent/Product change → corresponding reprice and owner; sufficient requirement/design with implementation deviation → realization_refactor and repair or reject candidate. Use the smallest lawful re-entry exposed by the referenced rule; unresolved meaning remains J and reserved choice O.",
